{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51477","headline":"江南冬日喜遇故人 · 李郢","name":"江南冬日喜遇故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南木落塞鸿飞，江汉离人久未归。\n客舍无成重相见，雪天留宿可相违。\n篇章只使容颜改，名利空教翰墨稀。\n终拟全家漾舟去，五湖高掩白云扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51477.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51477","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}